---
permalink: sitemap.xml
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<urlset xmlns="http://www.sitemaps.org/schemas/sitemap/0.9">
{#-
  Two exclusions, and they are two because this site hides a page in two
  different ways. Most content is hidden by swapping its layout to
  excluded.njk (see .eleventy.js's eleventyComputed), which the first test
  catches. Scene-POV pages don't use that mechanism - they keep their own
  layout and gate their body on `item.included`, set per character in
  _data/scenePovPages.js - so without the second test a narrowed clone
  advertised its hidden POV placeholders as real content.
-#}
{%- for entry in collections.all %}
{%- if entry.data.layout != "excluded.njk" and (not entry.data.item or entry.data.item.included) and entry.outputPath and entry.outputPath.endsWith(".html") %}
  <url><loc>{{ entry.url | absoluteUrl(site.url) }}</loc></url>
{%- endif %}
{%- endfor %}
</urlset>
